    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nThis charming three-bedroom terraced home offers a great opportunity for those seeking a convenient coastal lifestyle in the highly sought-after neighbourhood of Bayside. Freshly painted throughout and fitted with new carpets, the property is ready for occupancy while also having the potential to modernise or extend if desired. \n \nDesigned for modern living, this bright and comfortable home benefits from triple-glazed windows and gas-fired central heating. A particularly attractive feature is the property's private setting, as it is not directly overlooked to either the front or rear.\n\nAccommodation comprises, hall, kitchen with original serving hatch into the living/dining room to rear which also has good understairs storage. Upstairs are 3 good sized bedrooms and the family bathroom. \n\nThe back garden enjoys the added convenience of pedestrian access, making it ideal for families, cyclists, and outdoor enthusiasts. Parking is available on-street to the front of the property, with additional parking accessible to the rear.\n\nThe location is simply superb. Residents enjoy a wealth of local amenities within easy reach, including excellent shopping facilities, services, cafés, and recreational amenities. Bayside DART Station is just a short stroll away, providing a quick and convenient commute to the city centre and beyond. Families will also appreciate the selection of highly regarded primary and secondary schools nearby."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nHall - 1.80m x 2.39m\nOpen porch, composite door leading to tiled hallway\n\nKitchen - 2.30m x 2.71m\nTo left of hall, beechwood effect floor and wall cabinets, tiled floor and serving hatch out to dining area, electric cooker, hob and extractor fan, fridge/freezer,plumbed for washing machine and dishwasher\n\nLiving/Dining Room - 4.23m x 5.18m\nSpacious living/dining room with laminate wood flooring, and large floor to ceiling windows and door access to back garden, two storage presses to right\n\nBedroom 1 - 2.39m x 4.32m\nDouble to front, new carpet, built-in wardrobe\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.13m x 3.65m\nDouble to rear, new carpet, built-in wardrobe\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.02m x 2.72m\nSingle to rear, new carpet\n\nBathroom - 1.73m x 1.95m\nTo front, fully tiled, bath with Triton electric shower, w.c., wash hand basin\n\nFront Garden - \nLawn and pedestrian entrance, parking on street\n\nBack Garden - \nWalled back garden with rear access, block built shed, lawn and paved patio area\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Three-bedroom terraced home</li><li> Triple-glazed windows</li><li> Gas-fired central heating</li><li> Freshly painted throughout</li><li> New carpets fitted</li><li> Not overlooked to the front or rear</li><li> Rear garden access</li><li> On-street parking to the front and additional parking to the rear</li><li> Excellent location close to shops and everyday services</li><li> Short walk to Bayside DART Station</li><li> Excellent choice of schools in the locality</ul>"
      },
